## How to add a project

1. `scripts/new-project.sh <name> --stack next|vite|python`
2. Fill in `<project>/AGENTS.md` from `templates/AGENTS.md.template`.
3. Add one row above.

## Task geometry release rule

For UI work, trace oversized regions, sibling stretch and separated controls to
their first unnecessary expansion. Preserve the map/chart/content and keep the
primary information and action legible together. Record task-specific dimensions,
chrome, section height and decision proximity at 390/1024/1440 and the actual
working viewport. Prove a regression mutation fails the same budget. Palette,
type and source-lint checks do not clear geometry. Use the design framework's
DECISION-GEOMETRY.md or the installed anti-slop skill; if browser evidence is
unavailable, report unverified. Do not install tools or rewrite unrelated UI
solely because this template exists.
